    questionText: "With the entry of this new firm into the Irish health insurance market, outline two potential economic effects on the existing firms in the industry.",
    tariffModel: {"kind":"bestNofParts","notation":"2 @ 7","answer":2,"ofParts":8,"perPart":7}, totalMarks: 14,
