    questionText: "Amazon plans to open a dedicated store in Ireland in 2025. Outline two economic difficulties this may create for small and medium-sized retailers in Ireland.",
    tariffModel: {"kind":"bestNofParts","notation":"2 @ 5","answer":2,"ofParts":7,"perPart":5}, totalMarks: 10,
